{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "139", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "WRITING TASK 2", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15378738246579915, "w": 0.22863831072504315, "h": 0.023179739115831682, "c": 1, "size": 16.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "You should spend about 40 minutes on this task.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.188458736342404, "w": 0.5004288362505271, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Write about the following topic:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21678916185932667, "w": 0.325632094534569, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Many aspects of the way people dress today are influenced by global fashion", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.24571279399487503, "w": 0.806549406826501, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "trends.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27408026191924334, "w": 0.0778824275612502, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "How has global fashion become such a strong influence on people's lives? Do", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.30241061199338093, "w": 0.8064621580908131, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "you think this is a positive or negative development?", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.33074094320682235, "w": 0.5391306991186853, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Give reasons for your answer and include any relevant examples from your own", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.8261535877120972, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "knowledge or experience.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41632538865482344, "w": 0.27261854268365016, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Write at least 250 words.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4446557764503536, "w": 0.2605242121393031, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Essay [ Candidate Essay]", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5020828621302719, "w": 0.26499186515754036, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score. The", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5399061401222988, "w": 0.8075470771519757, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "given diagram describes the process of manufacturing bamboo fabrics. Overall,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5587435999999396, "w": 0.8073821145013037, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the process includes a few main stages, which are showen on the diagram and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.577581097598973, "w": 0.8068979916694374, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "are numbered from 1 to 8.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5965668779919665, "w": 0.2655635186687176, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The first stage, obviously, consists of planting and growing bamboo plants,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6154043378696074, "w": 0.8068105378838419, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "usually happening in spring.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6342418354686408, "w": 0.2891474875798708, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The second phase, We could say harvesting one, is happening in the middle part", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6530792953462816, "w": 0.8071155496214112, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of the year in autumn. Bamboo stems are cutting off by the season workers,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6721021935895058, "w": 0.8068109479836572, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "collecting and sendening to the special plants during this period.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6909396534671467, "w": 0.6617370105753465, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In the plants, what are showed a the third and the forth stages. on the diagram,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7097771133447875, "w": 0.807284818320143, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the bamboo stems are cutting into long strips, then produced strips are crushing", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7287628937377811, "w": 0.8070937118062508, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to make liquid pulp.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.747600429058207, "w": 0.20408399438860422, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "During the next phase these pulp is filtering through the special types of sieves", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7664378889358479, "w": 0.8069634025899649, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "to separate long fibres from liquid.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7852753488134887, "w": 0.3562710874606548, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Then the fibres, filtered by previous step, are being undergone through the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8042611292064822, "w": 0.8069198294845978, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "softenning procedure. This procedure includes adding water and amine oxide.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.823098589084123, "w": 0.8069850353552177, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The seventh stage is the sppinning the soften fibres to make a strong bamboo", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8419360489617639, "w": 0.8067674774032438, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "thread.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8609465745882446, "w": 0.07724463263924965, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Produced yarns might be used to make fabric, which is the last - eighth phase,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8986215697863114, "w": 0.8075922906566037, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "by weaveing them using special equipment.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9176073501793048, "w": 0.44681061785330584, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}